abstract: >-
  A multi-agent LLM system for gene regulatory network analysis.
  Built on LangGraph, it coordinates specialized domain agents
  to analyze ARACNe-inferred networks, perform pathway enrichment,
  and prioritize therapeutic targets through a conversational interface.
